The full provenance streams have now been processed: the 11,544-line plain log and all 189 JSONL records were parsed/hashed, with no JSON parse errors. They only repeat the candidate’s claimed `#Top`; the verdict below is based on the fresh builds, parser-level pinning, static inventory, body sensitivity, and valid non-vacuity probe. The remaining audit limitation is substantive but scoped: normal-return values are proved, while Python list identity/allocation and recursion-limit exceptions are outside the generated model.
